{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "102", "sample_idx": 5, "model_name": "mistralai/ministral-14b-instruct-2512", "content": "* **At the Curbside**\n  * *Her* (adjusting her gloves): \"You’re really going to wear those sweatpants? It’s a gala, Thomas.\"\n  * *Him* (grinning, leaning on the car): \"First time someone’s called them ‘vintage.’ Besides, I’m comfortable. You’re the one who looks like you’re ready to meet the queen—without an invitation.\"\n  * *Her* (raising an eyebrow): \"I *do* have an invitation. You have… a hoodie with a stain I refuse to ask about.\"\n  * *Him* (shrugging): \"Stain’s a story. Maybe I’ll tell you if you promise not to judge.\"\n\n* **Inside the Event (Mingling Near the Chairs)**\n  * *Her* (sipping champagne): \"You’re *shocking* people. That one guy just stared at you like you were a science experiment gone wrong.\"\n  * *Him* (nodding to the guy in question): \"Yeah, I think he’s judging my shoes too. These were free at the thrift store—consider it a uniform for ‘I don’t care.’\"\n  * *Her* (laughing): \"You *do* care. You spent 20 minutes picking out that ‘uniform.’\"\n  * *Him* (grinning): \"Strategy. If I blend in, no one questions why I’m here with *you* in this gown.\"\n\n* **Leaving the Event (Early Morning Light)**\n  * *Her* (yawning, leaning on his shoulder): \"Okay, fine. Your sweats *weren’t* the weirdest thing here tonight.\"\n  * *Him* (chuckling): \"Admit it, you had fun. You danced like no one was watching—then got all proper when the mayor walked by.\"\n  * *Her* (smirking): \"I *was* watching. Someone had to keep an eye on you.\"\n  * *Him* (opening the car door): \"Aw, jealous? Next time I’ll wear a bowtie. *Your* turn to question my outfit choices.\"\n  * *Her* (laughing as she slides in): \"Next time, I’m bringing sweatpants. And you’re wearing the gown.\"", "logprobs": [{"token": "*", "logprob": -0.13103777170181274}, {"token": " **", "logprob": -0.6349195837974548}, {"token": "At", "logprob": -0.85343009233474